    <briefdescription>
<para>Guarantees for BPMN model parsing and import. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><bold>Determinism:</bold> FULLY_DETERMINISTIC <linebreak/>
 <bold>Condition:</bold> UUID generation uses RFC 4122 v5 with stable namespace <linebreak/>
 <bold>Output:</bold> Identical BPMN source produces identical model structure</para>
<para><simplesect kind="invariant"><para>Multiple parses of the same BPMN produce identical model IDs </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="invariant"><para>Node and link ordering within model is stable </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="invariant"><para>No random element names or ordering </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="invariant"><para>Parse tree traversal is deterministic </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
